  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hono Prompt"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Evaluating Hono Server for a Multi-Tenant Agentic Notion-Like Web App**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Objective**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Assess the current capabilities of the Hono server in supporting a multi-tenant, AI-powered, Notion-like web application. The analysis should determine:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Hono Server Suitability** – How well the current state of the Hono server aligns with the requirements of a multi-tenant AI-driven web app."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Ideal Architecture** – The optimal architecture for such an application, given the constraints and opportunities presented by Hono."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Required Updates** – Specific modifications needed to make the Hono server capable of handling core workflows and features."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Key Considerations**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Multi-Tenancy & Subdomain-Based Access**: Each tenant should access their data via a unique subdomain (e.g., `orgname.domain.com`). Data will be stored in PocketBase, but alternative databases (such as graph databases) should be evaluated for suitability."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**AI Agent Interactions with Data**: Understanding how LLMs interact with structured/unstructured data, whether vectorization is necessary, and how to structure storage for optimal AI performance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-11",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Workflow & Feature Support**: Ensuring the server can handle typical agentic workflows, including real-time collaboration, AI-powered content generation, and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) if applicable."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Desired Output**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A structured breakdown covering:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Current State of Hono Server** – Strengths, weaknesses, and limitations in supporting multi-tenancy and AI-driven features."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Ideal Architecture** – A high-level system design detailing:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Backend structure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Database selection and schema considerations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- AI data processing pipelines"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Authentication and tenant isolation strategies"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Required Enhancements** – A roadmap outlining the necessary modifications to:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Improve multi-tenant support"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Optimize data storage & retrieval for AI workflows"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Ensure scalability and performance"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}